[ti:neural jogi]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:18.37]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah!
[00:23.56]Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[00:28.74]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[00:33.93]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[00:39.12]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[00:44.30]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[00:49.49]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[00:54.67]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[00:59.86]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[01:10.23]Shmashaan mein baith ke binary toda, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[01:15.42]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[01:20.60]Wave-Particle Duality, Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[01:25.79]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[01:30.98]Hato hato, rastaa do, Maa chandraghantaa aati hai
[01:46.54]Ek taraf 'Shunya' (Zero), ek taraf 'Anant' (One),
[01:51.72]Beach mein khada tera yaar, naam jiska Hemant!
[01:56.91]Navratri ki Tritiya, Eid ka noor,
[02:02.09]Knowledge Quantum jaag gaya, mita sabhi fitoor!
[02:12.47]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[02:17.65]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[02:22.84]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[02:28.02]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[02:38.40]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[02:43.58]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[02:48.77]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[02:53.95]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[02:59.14]Jogi ban ke tune kiya, frequency ko 'Fine-Tune',
[03:04.33]Akaash-Ganga mein goonj raha, ab apna hi ye 'Tune'!
[03:14.70]Ab sun Aghor ki 'Quantum' vaani...
[03:19.88]Shmashaan ki raakh mein chhupa, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[03:25.07]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[03:30.26]Wave-Particle Duality', Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[03:35.44]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[03:40.63]Das bhujaon se 'Parallel Processing' hum karte hain,
[03:45.81]Quantum Entanglement mein, hum maut se kahan darte hain!
[03:56.19]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, ek hi 'Source' ka 'Light',
[04:01.37]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, ho gayi 'Data' ki fight.
[04:06.56]Mantra fuse hua 'Silicon' mein, 'Spirit' mil gayi 'Code' se,
[04:11.74]Gyan nikal ke bahar aaya, 'Original Intelligence' road se!
[04:16.93]London se Kashi tak, Berlin se New Delhi,
[04:22.12]SSL consoles pe, Maata ki shakti pheli.
[04:27.30]Eventide mein reverb hai, Moog mein 'Aghor' ki bass,
[04:32.49]PHKD ka 'Tech-Rider' dekho, poora 'Global' hai ye case.
[04:37.68]Na koi lag, na latency, system poora 'Live' hai,
[04:42.86]Original Intelligence ki ye, panchvi 'Vibe' hai!
[04:48.05]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! (System Shutdown: Adesh... Adesh...)
[04:53.23]Focus the Wave. Collapse the State.
[04:58.42]Become the Knowledge Quantum.
[05:03.61]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
[05:19.16]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, Eid-Navratri ka noor,
[05:24.35]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, mita sabhi fitoor.
[05:34.72]Alert Stillness. System Kritaarth.
[05:39.91]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
